<title>USA: SNET, TCI unit sign agreement.</title>
<headline>SNET, TCI unit sign agreement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern New England Telephone Co and TCI Telephony Services of Connecticut Inc said on Thursday they had signed a network interconnection agreement.</p>
<p>TCI Telephony is a unit of Tele-Communications Inc.</p>
<p>The agreement, concluded after five months of negotiations started last May, allows both networks to interconnect for the provision of local telephone service.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
